57","warrior-g612","warrior-g741","warrior-g47","warrior-g763","warrior-g8","warrior-g89","warrior-g151","warrior-g752","warrior-g744","warrior-g719","warrior-g674"}}},title="Protection | WoW Forever Warrior Field Guide",nav={{id="overview",x=S[746]},{id="journey",x=S[605]},{id="talents",x=S[503]},{id="stats",x=S[658]},{id="combat",x=S[659]},{id="macros",x=S[636]},{id="dungeons",x=S[568]},{id="professions",x=S[606]},{id="crafting",x=S[587]},{id="questgear",x=S[544]},{id=S[497],x=S[709]}},asideNote=S[83],talentString="05000000000000000055000050000000000050530120301021251",ranks={{tree="Arms",name="Deflection",r=5,max=5},{tree="Fury",name="Cruelty",r=5,max=5},{tree="Fury",name=S[826],r=5,max=5},{tree="Fury",name="Enrage",r=5,max=5},{tree="Protection",name=S[727],r=5,max=5},{tree="Protection",name=S[847],r=5,max=5},{tree="Protection",name=S[803],r=3,max=3},{tree="Protection",name="Last Stand",r=1,max=1},{tree="Protection",name=S[791],r=2,max=2},{tree="Protection",name="Defiance",r=3,max=3},{tree="Protection",name="Vanguard",r=1,max=1},{tree="Protection",name=S[740],r=2,max=2},{tree="Protection",name=S[713],r=1,max=1},{tree="Protection",name=S[848],r=2,max=3},{tree="Protection",name="Bastion",r=5,max=5},{tree="Protection",name="Shield Slam",r=1,max=1}},order={{l1=10,l2=14,tree="Protection",name=S[727],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=15,l2=19,tree="Protection",name=S[847],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=20,l2=20,tree="Protection",name="Last Stand",r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=21,l2=22,tree="Protection",name=S[791],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=23,l2=25,tree="Protection",name=S[803],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=26,l2=28,tree="Protection",name="Defiance",r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=29,l2=29,tree="Protection",name="Vanguard",r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=30,l2=31,tree="Protection",name=S[740],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=32,l2=32,tree="Protection",name=S[713],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=33,l2=34,tree="Protection",name=S[848],r1=1,r2=2,max=3},{l1=35,l2=39,tree="Protection",name="Bastion",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=40,l2=40,tree="Protection",name="Shield Slam",r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=41,l2=45,tree="Arms",name="Deflection",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=46,l2=50,tree="Fury",name="Cruelty",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=51,l2=55,tree="Fury",name=S[826],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=56,l2=60,tree="Fury",name="Enrage",r1=1,r2=5,max=5}},blocks={{t="anchor",id="overview"},{t="p",s="eyebrow",x=S[546]},{t="h1",x="Protection",sub=S[637]},{t="p",s="lede",x="Level with a one-hander and shield in Defensive Stance: blocks, dodges and parries feed you Rage, Revenge and Shield Slam hit hard, and you can tank every dungeon you reach."},{t="pills",list={S[564],S[607]}},{t="anchor",id="journey"},{t="kicker",x=S[748]},{t="h2",x=S[467]},{t="p",x="These stages describe a practical route toward the level-60 build. Protection is the stronger leveling build up to about 40, especially if you also tank dungeons. From 40 you can add Fury as a second specialization for open-world questing."},{t="p",s="level",x="1–19 · Shield and Rage"},{t="p",x="Equip a one-hander and shield as soon as you can. Shield Specialization reaches 5/5 at 14: more block chance and 5 Rage every time you block. Do the level 10 class quest for Defensive Stance, Sunder Armor and Taunt. Anticipation (15–19) adds Defense, and Shield Block at 16 helps you block more often."},{t="p",s="level",x="20–39 · Vanguard and Bastion"},{t="p",x="Last Stand arrives at 20 and Master of Defense (21–22) gives Rage when you dodge or parry with a shield. Improved Revenge (23–25) makes Revenge a cheap, hard-hitting attack and Defiance (26–28) adds threat. Vanguard at 29 lets you Charge in Defensive Stance, so you can stay in it full time. Improved Shield Wall (30–31), Concussion Blow at 32 and Focused Rage (33–34) follow, then Bastion (35–39) for 10% more damage with a shield."},{t="p",s="level",x="40–60 · Shield Slam"},{t="p",x="Shield Slam at 40 is your strongest attack and scales with your block value. The last 20 points go into Deflection in Arms (41–45), then Cruelty, Lingering Rage and Enrage in Fury. Plate armor is trained at 40."},{t="anchor",id="talents"},{t="kicker",x=S[504]},{t="h2",x=S[564]},{t="p",x=S[65]},{t="widget",w="talents"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[569]},{t="widget",w="ranks"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[485]},{t="p",x=S[119]},{t="widget",w="order"},{t="p",s="notice",x="Bastion adds 10% to all damage you deal and Defiance adds 20% threat in Defensive Stance, but both only while a shield is equipped, so keep the shield on even when questing. Shield Specialization and Master of Defense turn blocks, dodges and parries into Rage, which makes Protection self-sufficient while leveling. Improved Shield Wall 2/2 shortens Shield Wall’s cooldown."},{t="anchor",id="stats"},{t="kicker",x=S[660]},{t="h2",x=S[527]},{t="p",x="Protection balances two lists: stats that make your attacks land for threat, and stats that keep you alive. Start balanced and lean defensive for hard-hitting bosses."},{t="h3",x=S[725]},{t="stat",i=1,b="Armor",x="shield and heavy armor"},{t="stat",i=2,b="Stamina",x=""},{t="stat",i=3,b="Strength",x="threat and block value"},{t="stat",i=4,b="Defense",x="fewer crits taken"},{t="stat",i=5,b=S[596],x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Keep a two-hander or dual-wield set for questing alone, and a shield set for dungeons."},{t="h3",x="At level 60: threat"},{t="stat",i=1,b="Hit chance",x="to 8%"},{t="stat",i=2,b="Expertise",x="to 6.5%, then 14% from the front"},{t="stat",i=3,b="Agility",x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Strength",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b="Stamina",x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Agility gives armor, dodge and crit, which makes it one of the best tank stats overall."},{t="h3",x="At level 60: survival"},{t="stat",i=1,b="Stamina",x=""},{t="stat",i=2,b="Armor",x=""},{t="stat",i=3,b="Agility",x="dodge and armor"},{t="stat",i=4,b="Avoidance",x="dodge and parry"},{t="stat",i=5,b="Defense",x="to 440"},{t="p",s="small",x="Shield Block also prevents critical hits, so Defense matters a little less for Warriors than for other tanks. Some estimates still put Defense to 440 second."},{t="p",s="notice",x="Melee hit cap: 8% for special attacks against raid bosses. Expertise removes dodge at 6.5% and parry at 14% (parry only matters from the front). Defense 440 makes a level 63 boss unable to land a critical hit on you. The level 60 list is an early estimate: the beta stopped at level 30, so expect changes once endgame gear is known. A big upgrade in a lower stat can still beat a small one in a higher stat."},{t="anchor",id="combat"},{t="kicker",x=S[528]},{t="h2",x=S[588]},{t="p",x="Treat this as a priority guide, not a fixed loop. Before Vanguard at 29, Concussion Blow at 32 and Shield Slam at 40, leave out the steps you have not unlocked."},{t="h4",x="Open in Defensive Stance"},{t="p",x="Keep Battle Shout up and use Bloodrage between pulls. From 29, Vanguard lets you Charge straight from Defensive Stance; before that, Charge in Battle Stance and switch. Defensive Stance cuts damage taken and dealt by 10% and adds 80% threat."},{t="h4",x="Shield Slam on cooldown"},{t="p",x="From 40, Shield Slam (20 Rage, 6-second cooldown) is your hardest hit and highest threat. Its damage rises with your block value, and it has a 50% chance to dispel a magic effect on the target."},{t="h4",x="Revenge whenever it lights up"},{t="p",x="Revenge becomes usable after you block, dodge or parry. It costs 5 Rage, has a 5-second cooldown and causes high threat; Improved Revenge adds 60% damage. Pair it with Sunder Armor in one button (see the macros)."},{t="h4",x="Shield Block for Rage"},{t="p",x="Shield Block (10 Rage, 5-second cooldown) raises block chance by 75% for 7 seconds, up to two blocks. Every block feeds Shield Specialization’s 5 Rage and enables Revenge, so use it often while tanking and questing."},{t="h4",x="Packs"},{t="p",x="Thunder Clap now works in Defensive Stance: it hits up to four enemies and slows their attacks by 20%. Add Demoralizing Shout, spread Sunder Armor with a mouseover macro, and Taunt anything that turns to a group member. Challenging Shout pulls everything back for 6 seconds in an emergency."},{t="h4",x="Emergencies"},{t="p",x="Last Stand grants 30% of your maximum health for 20 seconds. Shield Wall cuts damage taken by 60% for 12 seconds. Concussion Blow stuns for 5 seconds, and Shield Bash interrupts a cast. Retaliation and Shield Wall no longer share a cooldown."},{t="abil",names={"Shield Slam","Revenge","Shield Block","Sunder Armor","Thunder Clap","Taunt","Demoralizing Shout",S[713]}},{t="h3",x="Equipment and threat"},{t="p",x="Armor and Stamina come first for tanking, then Defense, Dodge, Parry and Block. Block value matters more than in Classic because it raises Shield Slam’s damage. While leveling solo, weapon damage per second and Strength still decide how fast you kill."},{t="p",x="Use the references below as candidate lists. Pick a one-handed weapon that can go in the main hand and the best shield you can find. Plate is trained at level 40; until then mail is your heaviest armor."},{t="h3",x=S[439]},{t="p",x="Protection takes less damage than other Warriors while leveling, but you still need food and bandages; Victory Rush helps in fights. Keep a sharpening stone or weightstone on your weapon for threat."},{t="p",x="Battle Shout and Booming Voice cover your group. Thunder Clap and Demoralizing Shout reduce the damage you take from packs. Taunt has an 8-second cooldown; Mocking Blow and Challenging Shout are your backups."},{t="anchor",id="macros"},{t="kicker",x=S[638]},{t="h2",x=S[440]},{t="p",x=S[61]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[41]},{t="macro",n=S[498],x="With Vanguard you can Charge from Battle or Defensive Stance out of combat. In Berserker Stance this Intercepts (from 30).",code="#showtooltip\n/cast [nocombat,stance:1/2] Charge; [stance:3] Intercept"},{t="macro",n=S[608],x=S[154],code=S[259]},{t="macro",n=S[704],x=S[326],code=S[275]},{t="macro",n=S[710],x=S[195],code=S[295]},{t="macro",n=S[589],x=S[218],code=S[253]},{t="macro",n=S[499],x=S[226],code=S[351]},{t="macro",n=S[500],x=S[156],code=S[305]},{t="macro",n="Ranged pull",x=S[237],code=S[171]},{t="macro",n=S[515],x=S[166],code=S[276]},{t="macro",n="Revenge, otherwise Sunder",x="Casts Revenge when it is available; otherwise the same press casts Sunder Armor. One button for most of your threat.",code="#showtooltip Revenge\n/cast Revenge\n/cast Sunder Armor"},{t="macro",n="Shield Slam / Shift Shield Block",x="Normal press casts Shield Slam. Hold Shift for Shield Block to set up blocks, Rage and Revenge.",code="#showtooltip\n/cast [mod:shift] Shield Block; [harm,nodead] Shield Slam"},{t="macro",n="Last Stand + Shield Wall",x="Emergency button. Last Stand first for the extra health, then Shield Wall if you are in Defensive Stance.",code="#showtooltip Shield Wall\n/cast Last Stand\n/cast [stance:2] Shield Wall"},{t="macro",n="Mouseover Concussion Blow",x="Stun a dangerous enemy under your pointer for 5 seconds without changing your tanking target.",code="#showtooltip Concussion Blow\n/cast [@mouseover,harm,nodead][harm,nodead] Concussion Blow"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[318]},{t="anchor",id="dungeons"},{t="kicker",x=S[711]},{t="h2",x=S[486]},{t="p",x=S[67]},{t="widget",w="rarity"},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[68]},{t="p",s="notice",x="Warrior loot selection · 30 October 2026. Mail and plate armor, shields, cloaks and jewelry, every melee weapon type, and bows, guns, crossbows and thrown weapons; Intellect-, Spirit- and spell-only pieces are excluded. Two-handed weapons are hidden on the Protection page. Rarity and acquisition confidence remain separate."},{t="widget",w="loot"},{t="anchor",id="professions"},{t="kicker",x=S[529]},{t="h2",x=S[483]},{t="p",x=S[81]},{t="widget",w="prof"},{t="anchor",id="crafting"},{t="kicker",x=S[570]},{t="h2",x=S[468]},{t="p",x=S[35]},{t="widget",w="craft"},{t="anchor",id="questgear"},{t="kicker",x=S[530]},{t="h2",x=S[426]},{t="p",x=S[36]},{t="widget",w="quest"},{t="anchor",id=S[497]},{t="kicker",x=S[712]},{t="h2",x="Your notes"},{t="widget",w="notes"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[101]}}}},dungeons={{n=S[639],