rs with Mining. The best pieces bind on pickup, so you craft them yourself."},{n="Mining",b="Ore and stone for Blacksmithing and Engineering, and steady income from bars.",camp="Lodestone: a melee attack power bonus at your campsite.",cv="Level it while you quest; catching up later costs a lot of time."},{n="Engineering",b="Explosives that work in any stance and cost no Rage, guns and scopes for pulling, target dummies and repair bots.",cv="Pairs with Mining. Gnomes fail less often with engineering devices thanks to their racial."},{n="Alchemy",b="Strength, Agility and Defense elixirs, Rage potions, protection potions and Free Action Potions for dungeons.",cv="Ordinary healing potions are First Aid crafts in Forever; discolored Alchemy potions have a different effect."},{n=S[42],b="Mail armor and armor kits; Camp Tent gives a little rested experience while leveling.",camp="Camp Tent: a small amount of rested experience.",cv="Most of its armor is leather. Only the mail and armor kits are listed here for a Warrior."},{n="Skinning",b="Leather, hides and scales from beasts; easy early income for training costs and new weapon skills.",camp="Camp Chair: a critical strike bonus at your campsite.",cv="Pairs with Leatherworking, or sell the materials."},{n="Herbalism",b="Herbs for Alchemy, or income if you sell them.",cv="Gathering only; no direct combat bonus."},{n="Cooking",b="Food with Strength, Agility, Stamina or attack power buffs. Buff food also adds 5% experience from kills while leveling.",cv="Warriors recover health with food and bandages, so Cooking saves a lot of gold and downtime."},{n="First Aid",b="Bandages, normal healing potions, anti-venoms and remedies for poison, disease and bleeds.",camp="First Aid Kit: a Stamina bonus at your campsite.",cv="Damage interrupts bandaging; read combat restrictions on cures."},{n="Fishing",b="Fish for Cooking, including buff food ingredients.",camp="Fish Bowl: an all-stats bonus at your campsite.",cv="No guaranteed income is